<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Wisdom and Delusion of LLM Ensemblesfor Code Generation and Repair" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Threats to Validity</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Wisdom and Delusion of LLM Ensemblesfor Code Generation and Repair" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
