<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_leqno">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Wisdom and Delusion of LLM Ensembles
<br class="ltx_break">for Code Generation and Repair</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_doi"><span class="ltx_note_name">DOI: </span><a href="https://doi.org/XXXXXXX.XXXXXXX">XXXXXXX.XXXXXXX</a></span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_conference"><span class="ltx_note_name">Conference: </span>Conference; 2026; </span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Computing methodologies Ensemble methods</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Software and its engineering Software development techniques</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Computing methodologies Natural language processing</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>General and reference Empirical studies</span></span></span>
